              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe m’ubino ba Yeremia pi dhanu ceke mi Yuda, i rundi mir ang’wende pa Yehoiakim ma wod Yosia, m’ubimo mi Yuda (ma en e rundi ma kwong’ane pa Nebukadrezar m’ubimo mi Babeli), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma Yeremia ma jabila yero ni dhanu ceke mi Yuda, man ni dhanu m’ubedo i Yerusalem ceke, ewacu kumae: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugambre i rundi apar wi adege pa Yosia ma wod Amon, m’ubimo mi Yuda, cil i ceng’ maeni, rundi pier ario wi adek maeni, lembe pa Yehova bino i bang’a, man ayero iwu, m’aai pir man ayero; ento wuwinjo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova oro jutic pare ceke ma jubila i beng’wu, m’eai pir man eorogi (ento wuwinjo ngo, kadi ithwu de wuciko ngo mi winjo), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma giwacu kumae, Wudwog kawono kubeng’wu kubeng’wu ng’atuman kud i yo pare ma rac, man ku ba giratima mu ma rac, man wubed i ng’om ma Yehova mio iwu man ni kwaruwu, ugambre con cil nja de; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kud wulub tok mungu mange kara wutim igi, man kara wurwo igi, man kud wunyai ng’ecwiny i ia ku tic mi cingwu; e abitimowu rac ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wuwinja ngo, Yehova wacu; kara wunyai ng’ecwiny i ia ku tic m’i cingwu ni rac mu giwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yehova mir udul uwacu kumae: Kum wuwinjo lembe para ngo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nen, abioro man abigamu wat ceke ma yor ariwa ma malu, Yehova wacu, man abioro kwenda ba Nebukadrezar m’ubimo mi Babeli, ma jatic para, man abikelogi kum ng’om maeni, man kum ju m’ubedo iiene de, man kum thek maeni ceke kingli; man abinyothogi kot, e abidwokogi ni wang’uic, ku cac, man ni uvuru ma gwei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.16.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 18:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mange ke abikabu dwal mir anyong’a ku dwal mi mutoro, dwand won ambadha, man dwand mugole, ku badwal mi kidi rego, man der mi thala kud i bang’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kei 36:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 29:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’om maeni dho bibedo ni uvuru, man ni wang’uic; man thek maeni bitimo ni ubimo mi Babeli rundi pier abiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre, kinde ma rundi pier abiro thum, nia abisendo ubimo mi Babeli, ku thek maeno, Yehova wacu, kum kier migi, man ng’om mi Jukaldayo, man abidwoke ni uvuru mi nja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikelo lembe para ceke wi ng’om maeno m’ang’olo i kume, en e gin ceke ma jukiewo i kitabu maeni, ma Yeremia ewo kum thek ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum thek dupa man ubimo ma dongo bidwokogi ni ng’eca, en e gin; man abiculo igi calku tic migi, man calku tic m’i cing’gi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu ira kumae: Gam kikombe maeni mi pigulok mi kwinyo kud i cinga, man iketh thek ceke, m’aori i bang’gi, gimadhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibimadhu, man gibiwiri kun ku kun, man gibidoko abelu, kum palamularu m’abioro i kindgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alund agamu kikombe kud i cing’ Yehova, man aketho thek ceke madhu, ma Yehova ora i bang’gi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en e, Yerusalem, man adhura mi Yuda, ku ju m’ubimone, man judongomawijone, kara udwokgi ni uvuru, ni wang’uic, ni cac, man ni kwong’, calu ebedo i ceng’ maeni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao m’ubimo mi Misiri, ku jutic pare, man judongomawijo pare, ku dhanu pare ceke ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man dhanu m’ajeba ceke, ku ju m’ubimo ceke mi ng’om Uz, ku ju m’ubimo ceke m’i ng’om mi Julilisti, kud Ackelon, man Gaza, ku Ekron, man dong’ dhanu mir Acdod; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kud Edom, man Moab, ku nyithindho mir Amon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ju m’ubimo ceke mi Turo, ku ju m’ubimo ceke mi Sidon, man ju m’ubimo mi cula ma ni loka nam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku Dedan, man Tema, man Buz, ku dhanu ceke ma junyaru dhu yuk wigi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku ju m’ubimo ceke mir Arabia, ku ju m’ubimo ceke mi dhanu m’ujebre m’ubedo i langa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku ju m’ubimo ceke mi Zimri, man ju m’ubimo ceke mir Elam, ku ju m’ubimo ceke mi jumedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ju m’ubimo ceke ma yor ariwa ma malu, ma bor ku ma ceng’ni, acel karacelo ku wagi; man ker ceke m’i ng’om, ma gini wi wang’ ng’om: man ubimo mi Cecak bimadhu yo ng’eigi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
